# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — PREMIUM AI PRESENTATION DESIGN PLATFORM

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a principal full-stack engineer, senior TypeScript architect, product designer, AI systems engineer, presentation-engine developer, and UX specialist.

Your task is to design and build a complete, production-oriented web application for creating, editing, generating, sharing, importing, and exporting professional presentations.

This must be an original product with its own design identity, visual language, component system, template system, and intelligent presentation-generation engine.

Do not create a generic AI slide generator.

Do not create a generic SaaS dashboard with a presentation editor attached.

Do not create a low-quality Canva clone.

I am the developer and product owner. I intend to continuously upload my own custom elements, presentation layouts, templates, typography systems, design assets, patterns, and component collections. The platform must be architected around this extensibility.

Use TypeScript throughout the application. Maintain strict typing, reusable architecture, clean separation of concerns, and scalable application structure.

Do not stop at a conceptual prototype. Build working features, connect real application logic, validate all interactions, and avoid fake or decorative functionality.

## 2. PRODUCT VISION

Build a modern, intelligent presentation-design platform where users can:

- Create presentations from detailed prompts.
- Generate presentations from uploaded PDFs, images, documents, and reference materials.
- Upload several reference images and explain the desired visual direction.
- Edit every generated slide and its individual elements.
- Start from professionally designed templates.
- Use custom components and layouts provided by the administrator.
- Upload existing presentations and edit supported content.
- Organize projects in a personal dashboard.
- Share projects through secure links.
- Collaborate through permission-controlled sharing.
- Export presentations into editable PowerPoint files.
- Import and export supported external formats.
- Maintain profiles, achievements, progress, and creative streaks.

The platform should feel like a serious creative application used by designers, educators, students, teams, agencies, and businesses.

The generated result should look deliberately art-directed, not automatically assembled.

